Triagers
- Open for nomination. A triager triages issues, reproduces bugs, and
  guides contributors through the review process.

Maintainer expectations
- Review pull requests within one week.
- Respond to security reports within 72 hours.
- Keep the roadmap and changelog accurate.
- Enforce the code of conduct.

Becoming a maintainer
- Demonstrate sustained contributions and reliable reviews.
- Be nominated by an existing maintainer.
- Reach consensus within the maintainer team.

If you are a maintainer and want to step down, post a notice in the issue
tracker so the change of role is visible to the community.